### Create player profile
POST http://localhost:8086/profiles
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "accountId": "4719fcf0-ada5-4268-8bb7-c329c83f3a15",
  "fullName": "Test Player",
  "dateOfBirth": "1999-04-15",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "email": "test.player@example.com",
  "phone": "+3725000100",
  "address": "Tallinn",
  "language": "en",
  "currency": "EUR"
}

### Get player profile by id
GET http://localhost:8086/profiles/9c7b119d-b95d-4170-98c8-d44da0907568

### Update player profile
PUT http://localhost:8086/profiles/9c7b119d-b95d-4170-98c8-d44da0907568
content-type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "4719fcf0-ada5-4268-8bb7-c329c83f3a15",
  "fullName": "Test Player Updated",
  "dateOfBirth": "1999-04-15",
  "status": "INACTIVE",
  "email": "updated.player@example.com",
  "phone": "+3725000100",
  "address": "Tartu",
  "language": "et",
  "currency": "EUR"
}

### Update contact details
PATCH http://localhost:8086/profiles/9c7b119d-b95d-4170-98c8-d44da0907568/contact
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "contact.only@example.com",
  "phone": "+3725000757",
  "address": "Parnuuuuu"
}

### Update preferences
PATCH http://localhost:8086/profiles/9c7b119d-b95d-4170-98c8-d44da0907568/preferences
content-type: application/json

{
  "language": "en",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Get profile by account id
GET http://localhost:8086/profiles/account/4719fcf0-ada5-4268-8bb7-c329c83f3a15